cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization in research, please cite the specific
  archived release of TruncatedSieveFlux.
type: software
title: "TruncatedSieveFlux: Lean 4 Formalization of Finite Möbius Sieve Identities and Periodic Rounding-Error Moments"
authors:
  - family-names: Odasso
    given-names: Alessandro
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of finite truncated Möbius sieve
  identities, an explicit logarithmic-cutoff residual bound, exact
  periodic modular covariance and Möbius-weighted second-moment identities,
  and elementary fourth-moment inequalities. Selected statements have
  been checked through independent Comparator configurations. The
  proposed uniform quadratic fourth-moment bound remains unproved,
  and no mathematical originality claim is made.
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexodas/TruncatedSieveFlux"
url: "https://github.com/alexodas/TruncatedSieveFlux"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Möbius function
  - sieve theory
  - number theory
  - periodic rounding errors
  - research software
